#. <CLT 4>もう、こんなモニターなんかに怯えない。
#. モノクマなんか怖くない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not gonna let these things scare me anymore... I'm\n"
"not afraid of you, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間に限りがあります…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have much time left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>分厚い鉄板で隠された窓…
#. その向こうには……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The window's completely covered by that metal plate.\n"
"And just on the other side of it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ帰れるはずだ。
#. いや、絶対に帰ってみせる！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I'll get out of here soon. No...I absolutely\n"
"HAVE to get out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>分厚い鉄板で隠された窓…
#. その向こうには……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The window's completely covered by that metal plate.\n"
"And just on the other side of it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ帰れるはずだ。
#. いや、絶対に帰ってみせる！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I'll get out of here soon. No...I absolutely\n"
"HAVE to get out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

